Meh, I'd use power over dex in the early game for most casters.

The difference between dex gloves and leather is really very close to
zero, unless the dex are very highly enchanted and luck isn't maxed
(rather a rare scenario).  Close enough that I wouldn't bother wishing
for dex if I had leather, a full ascension kit, and 10 extra wishes.

> The choice among head gear is more complex.  A spell caster
> may want an elven leather helmet until corun-mumble or
> brilliance is found but a character without infravision benefits
